ampling-2024" target="area:sparse"><data key="relation">bridges_field</data><data key="epistemic_status">curated_classification</data><data key="evidence">Unifies learning from linear samples for nonlinear model classes, including compressed sensing and active regression.</data><data key="evidence_url">https://proceedings.mlr.press/v235/adcock24a.html</data><data key="evidence_locator">Broad field classification based on stated method/application; not a novelty claim</data></edge><edge id="e471" source="deepvivonet-2025" target="area:sparse"><data key="relation">bridges_field</data><data key="epistemic_status">curated_classification</data><data key="evidence">Uses marine-riser field data for sparse reconstruction and forecasting, then optimizes sensor placement with an outer loop.</data><data key="evidence_url">https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.04105</data><data key="evidence_locator">Broad field classification based on stated method/application; not a novelty claim</data></edge><edge id="e472" source="eim-2004" target="area:integration"><data key="relation">bridges_field</data><data key="epistemic_status">curated_classification</data><data key="evidence">Builds a reduced representation of parameter-dependent functions using selected evaluation points.</data><data key="evidence_url">https://www.mit.edu/~cuongng/publication/pub1/</data><data key="evidence_locator">Broad field classification based on stated method/application; not a novelty claim</data></edge><edge id="e473" source="deim-2009" target="area:integration"><data key="relation">bridges_field</data><data key="epistemic_status">curated_classification</data><data key="evidence">Uses a reduced basis and selected entries to cheaply approximate nonlinear terms.</data><data key="evidence_url">https://laertes.caam.rice.edu/tech_reports/2009/TR09-05.pdf</data><data key="evidence_locator">Broad field classification based on stated method/application; not a novelty claim</data></edge><edge id="e474" source="ecm-2017" target